                                                "sense_id": "b79bc438-6e76-360a-8553-1db8e45c7328",
                                                "text": "Turning manure and many other things we've hitherto done by day work, we'll do by piece work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a95f807-03a5-48fd-b8b2-ba0256e07bce",
                                                "sense_id": "b79bc438-6e76-360a-8553-1db8e45c7328",
                                                "text": "We have seen details of the types of work for which volunteers are sought, and these range from the manufacture of camouflage nets, on piece work in the Central London area, enabling approximately 6s. a shift of 4 hours to be earned, [...]."
